 tretch: 2 x 30 sec each side\nStanding hip rotations: 5 each way\, each le
 g\nHalf kneeling thoracic rotation: 2 x 8 each side\nHip and chest separat
 ion in golf posture: 2 x 10 each way\nNo-sway turn drill: 2 x 10 slow turn
